{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 223.0973125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.84,
      "text": "真的很討厭上了一種臉上的明顯的顆粒感很感"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 3.84,
      "end": 4.6,
      "text": "被個人感覺"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 4.6,
      "end": 6.64,
      "text": "我的妝感很重皮膚很差"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 6.64,
      "end": 8.2,
      "text": "所以雖然我是一個勇皮"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 8.2,
      "end": 9.68,
      "text": "普妝的細膩度"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 9.68,
      "end": 10.92,
      "text": "在我這裡的視"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 10.92,
      "end": 11.72,
      "text": "第一重要的"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 13.32,
      "text": "我喜歡那種那種皮膚太差"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 13.32,
      "end": 15.76,
      "text": "比較好那樣乾淨通透的一妝感"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 15.76,
      "end": 19.28,
      "text": "今天天真習是我從幾十塊分的一選傳"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 19.28,
      "end": 20.2,
      "text": "雖然有一些網絡"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 20.2,
      "end": 22.4,
      "text": "各種家裡都有妝感好看"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 22.4,
      "end": 23.96,
      "text": "用吃妝還不會蠻鬥的"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 23.96,
      "end": 24.96,
      "text": "我昨天是這個很長"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 24.96,
      "end": 27.44,
      "text": "其實我在二二年就做過對院測試"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 27.44,
      "end": 29.44,
      "text": "粉質非常非常吸引"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 29.44,
      "end": 30.64,
      "text": "其實特别薄"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 30.64,
      "end": 32.64,
      "text": "用手都很好的抹凌"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 32.64,
      "end": 34.12,
      "text": "很色滑有點像在圖欺騙"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 34.12,
      "end": 35.28,
      "text": "我自己平得感覺"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 35.28,
      "end": 36.48,
      "text": "上臉後就是給人一種"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 36.48,
      "end": 37.44,
      "text": "4月鏡頭"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 37.44,
      "end": 39.44,
      "text": "不論是偷老的貴婦積感"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 39.44,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "你看就是日子過得很濃郁的那種"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 42.0,
      "end": 43.16,
      "text": "雖然雖然雖然不是很高"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 43.16,
      "end": 45.28,
      "text": "但是舒適的效果很棒"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 45.28,
      "end": 46.72,
      "text": "也不暗沉帶妝的膩"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 46.72,
      "end": 48.96,
      "text": "在貴婦很妝裡面是很好的"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 48.96,
      "end": 50.88,
      "text": "那他就是我帶妝是十二個小時"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 50.88,
      "end": 51.76,
      "text": "下來他演出的"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 51.76,
      "end": 52.8,
      "text": "在我臉上出油"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 52.8,
      "end": 54.12,
      "text": "不會那種搬火"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 54.12,
      "end": 56.0,
      "text": "粉都會粉變成為鼓舞"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 56.0,
      "end": 57.76,
      "text": "按鈴按鈴是很完略的領裝"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 57.76,
      "end": 58.96,
      "text": "那時候的粉變為一樣"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 58.96,
      "end": 59.8,
      "text": "給你們按鈴塊"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 59.8,
      "end": 61.12,
      "text": "給你一場按鈴塊"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 61.12,
      "end": 62.24,
      "text": "他的這個款式"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 62.24,
      "end": 63.64,
      "text": "特别臭的仔細"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 63.64,
      "end": 65.16,
      "text": "上臉之後感覺是照顧"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 65.16,
      "end": 66.36,
      "text": "小薄的沙一樣"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 66.36,
      "end": 67.84,
      "text": "又不明的就種角"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 69.2,
      "text": "很自然的體量無色"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 69.2,
      "end": 70.84,
      "text": "但是又不會假面甲的"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 70.84,
      "end": 72.24,
      "text": "防禮是兩個上粉電視"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 72.24,
      "end": 73.84,
      "text": "頭突然味似綁善之間"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 73.84,
      "end": 75.84,
      "text": "跟他非常快速的出門"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 75.84,
      "end": 76.96,
      "text": "直雙力也是很暗"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 76.96,
      "end": 78.12,
      "text": "在線的好幾次"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 78.12,
      "end": 80.2,
      "text": "用他從去上不拉曲課"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 80.2,
      "end": 81.6,
      "text": "我留了一年的漢"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 81.6,
      "end": 83.44,
      "text": "但是裝飾一點都沒有獨"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 83.44,
      "end": 85.12,
      "text": "而且出油量三六月平時"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 85.12,
      "end": 86.36,
      "text": "很容易上了很多"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 86.36,
      "end": 87.48,
      "text": "而且這薄薄的一個"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 87.48,
      "end": 88.96,
      "text": "都算是放在那種小薄的"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 88.96,
      "end": 89.6,
      "text": "最薄裡面"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 89.6,
      "end": 90.52,
      "text": "也不佔定方"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 90.52,
      "end": 92.08,
      "text": "帶出的補裝很方便"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 92.08,
      "end": 94.08,
      "text": "像油皮下天出油多了"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 94.08,
      "end": 95.48,
      "text": "我們會練上有些損芳"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 95.48,
      "end": 96.6,
      "text": "在這裡跟你們分享"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 96.6,
      "end": 97.96,
      "text": "各種裝小品牙"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 97.96,
      "end": 100.2,
      "text": "就是先用他們家的那個西油"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 100.2,
      "end": 102.6,
      "text": "是把熱量上的油光給按壓掉"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 102.6,
      "end": 104.96,
      "text": "然後再反正分裂別的圖上去"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 104.96,
      "end": 106.36,
      "text": "他的用你的裝開上去"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 106.36,
      "end": 107.52,
      "text": "像是剛花的一樣"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 107.52,
      "end": 108.68,
      "text": "其實還是一個來"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 108.68,
      "end": 109.68,
      "text": "油脂分裂別的"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 109.68,
      "end": 111.72,
      "text": "雖然是補或加深重起來"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 111.72,
      "end": 112.92,
      "text": "真的很珍惜"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 112.92,
      "end": 113.92,
      "text": "跟我有過的規築"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 113.92,
      "end": 115.04,
      "text": "從什麼時候很屬於"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 115.04,
      "end": 116.72,
      "text": "至於很滋滑"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 116.72,
      "end": 118.4,
      "text": "我再練上一下子就可以"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 118.4,
      "end": 120.04,
      "text": "跟我的皮膚的彎質"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 120.04,
      "end": 121.04,
      "text": "而且很屬於"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 121.04,
      "end": 122.0,
      "text": "我之前失過"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 123.2,
      "text": "帶裝一整天"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 123.2,
      "end": 124.56,
      "text": "眼影都暈掉了"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 124.56,
      "end": 125.72,
      "text": "但是他還是狼狼的"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 125.72,
      "end": 126.52,
      "text": "巴特變質"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 126.52,
      "end": 127.96,
      "text": "不脫裝也不暗成"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 127.96,
      "end": 129.84,
      "text": "和油皮的失業都很港"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 129.84,
      "end": 131.44,
      "text": "就是他們家的這個色號"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 131.44,
      "end": 132.4,
      "text": "真的是很好的水"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 132.4,
      "end": 134.04,
      "text": "我只有用的CN0依裁"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 134.04,
      "end": 134.6,
      "text": "不覺得黑"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 134.6,
      "end": 135.48,
      "text": "但就是這個"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 135.48,
      "end": 137.96,
      "text": "他算是油皮分裂你的狼狼"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 137.96,
      "end": 138.96,
      "text": "主打的就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 138.96,
      "end": 140.84,
      "text": "食色是裝確實"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 140.84,
      "end": 142.04,
      "text": "我以後很屬於"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 142.04,
      "end": 144.2,
      "text": "裝而色是用越來越美麗的"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 145.84,
      "text": "質地是那種塑乾淨的"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 145.84,
      "end": 146.4,
      "text": "折甩力"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 146.4,
      "end": 147.84,
      "text": "比我之前很想過的狼狼"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 147.84,
      "end": 148.52,
      "text": "都讓起"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 148.52,
      "end": 150.12,
      "text": "剛上臉會有人擔憂"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 150.12,
      "end": 151.8,
      "text": "A、CN0依製化的裝"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 151.8,
      "end": 152.88,
      "text": "但屬於的比裝"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 152.88,
      "end": 153.72,
      "text": "一定失落了"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 153.72,
      "end": 155.04,
      "text": "很貴的那種乾淨"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 155.04,
      "end": 156.16,
      "text": "雖然有你的折甩力"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 156.16,
      "end": 157.0,
      "text": "但是不想念"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 157.0,
      "end": 158.4,
      "text": "出油之後會帶臉上"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 158.4,
      "end": 158.96,
      "text": "是一種"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 158.96,
      "end": 160.2,
      "text": "非常微妙的光澤"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 160.2,
      "end": 160.68,
      "text": "感悠心"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 160.68,
      "end": 161.44,
      "text": "整個裝甩"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 161.44,
      "end": 162.04,
      "text": "氣痛"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 162.04,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "而且用了他"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 163.0,
      "end": 164.2,
      "text": "不管是做運動"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 164.2,
      "end": 165.4,
      "text": "還是搭下貼的"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 165.4,
      "end": 166.2,
      "text": "去吃火鍋"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 166.2,
      "end": 167.2,
      "text": "它都不代表的"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 167.2,
      "end": 168.4,
      "text": "但就是這款"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 168.4,
      "end": 169.48,
      "text": "中藏要很爽"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 169.48,
      "end": 171.36,
      "text": "這個我只是做個特品的"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 171.36,
      "end": 172.24,
      "text": "它的優點"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 172.24,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "就是很氣和油動機"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 174.36,
      "end": 175.96,
      "text": "不管你是正在著動"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 175.96,
      "end": 177.04,
      "text": "還是很暗漲的"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 177.04,
      "end": 178.2,
      "text": "都可能用它"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 178.2,
      "end": 179.16,
      "text": "上臉是那種"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 179.16,
      "end": 180.96,
      "text": "微光澤的奶油機"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 180.96,
      "end": 182.08,
      "text": "就算你眼上有很多的"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 182.08,
      "end": 182.56,
      "text": "下臉的時候"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 182.56,
      "end": 183.32,
      "text": "但是你用了它"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 183.32,
      "end": 184.12,
      "text": "就會有沒有覺得"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 184.12,
      "end": 185.6,
      "text": "我的皮膚看起來很乾淨"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 185.6,
      "end": 186.44,
      "text": "我之前還拿"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 186.44,
      "end": 187.92,
      "text": "它和那個大臉定名的"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 187.92,
      "end": 189.2,
      "text": "你以前多的女革"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 189.2,
      "end": 189.92,
      "text": "我本來你一起做"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 189.92,
      "end": 190.96,
      "text": "作作要給你對結果"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 190.96,
      "end": 191.64,
      "text": "它就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 191.64,
      "end": 192.92,
      "text": "完全不舒適"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 192.92,
      "end": 193.96,
      "text": "長超越女環"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 193.96,
      "end": 195.08,
      "text": "概念到我臉上效果"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 195.08,
      "end": 195.84,
      "text": "最後是"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 195.84,
      "end": 196.36,
      "text": "習慣"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 196.36,
      "end": 197.52,
      "text": "前期間我買了好"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 197.52,
      "end": 197.96,
      "text": "我都好多"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 197.96,
      "end": 198.84,
      "text": "但是我發覺是"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 198.84,
      "end": 200.16,
      "text": "有時的肌臉是那種"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 200.16,
      "end": 201.08,
      "text": "它也上了"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 201.08,
      "end": 201.92,
      "text": "大部分的肌臉"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": 201.92,
      "end": 202.8,
      "text": "都不吃妝"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": 202.8,
      "end": 204.0,
      "text": "非常容易冷妝"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 204.0,
      "end": 205.12,
      "text": "這才是假的就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
