      "text": "有體肌臉"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": 206.12,
      "end": 207.2,
      "text": "食妝的層層"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": 207.2,
      "end": 208.68,
      "text": "粉質也很吸引"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": 208.68,
      "end": 210.04,
      "text": "跟臉發得很忙"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
